THIRD-PARTY SOURCES AND ATTRIBUTION
==================================

This project is an independent, method-level distillation of the following talk:

  Title:      "How to build (un)believable worlds?"
  Speaker:    Helen Hindpere (writer, Disco Elysium; lead writer, The Final Cut)
  Event:      Konsoll 2023, Day 2, 13:00-14:00
  Reference:  https://discoelysium.wiki.gg/wiki/Further_Elysium_Media

  Bilibili upload used for cross-checking:
  https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vo4h6UEqq
  Uploader: 日珥蜡Ria
