  upload were produced manually by the uploader.

WHAT IS AND IS NOT INCLUDED
===========================

Included:
  - Original, rewritten descriptions of methods, principles and design patterns.
  - Factual identifiers and technical terms (proper nouns, pattern names).
  - Our own examples, checklists, templates and code.

Not included (deliberately):
  - No verbatim transcript or subtitle lines.
  - No translated slide wording reproduced verbatim.
  - No slides, screenshots, images or video/audio assets from the talk.

All explanatory prose in this repository was written from scratch. Proper
nouns are used only to identify concepts and works; they remain the property
of their respective holders. The talk and its slides remain the property of
Helen Hindpere / Konsoll 2023. The Chinese translation remains the work of the
Bilibili uploader.

